hw&oe=6AF89CA5"}, {"file_name": "shot4-ocean-corridor-2560x1440.png", "id": "4497773230460693", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_4497773233794026_2378065632482896655_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7X4iReGX7cQQ7kNvwFFkPKY&_nc_oc=Ado9iBixJw2wrX2F1HBY5MQjYQwxsUkvZDZVlFoeDI3WTjROhyn5BjiaHwHODUHTU9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSD-8uFmjiGXHizjQt7RYWIcvhm0sdM6fWgJNS_z3TCZg&oe=6AF8ADCB"}, {"file_name": "shot5-candy-atrium-2560x1440.png", "id": "1137219598660567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/753032404_1137219601993900_2749005974352618899_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FWlz_OZlKjQQ7kNvwGuC05j&_nc_oc=AdpUsr2gLm-jXVbgBg-Q98XpeT3Y80Tv1L6vX1sym2nr1OkbgniY3XSF6Uvw-I0orlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQ1MyPqN7mWc2RO_cVQNXvKYtouoyjQge9t_SKQhwoVg&oe=6AF8922F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover-2560x1440.png", "id": "1340311138181874", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1340311141515207_7286301901624474087_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w60Gj34KUBAQ7kNvwE9rEpz&_nc_oc=AdozfEovuh5itOrGzt_nQ6FRfiorSvz1J9W80WgZ6PxsieF2LgXNZLeI-_zNAoxnpcU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-oAJRTp4yzoDvcl-zTw-N4unVK0Ux0rFmQJo7HkNGqA&oe=6AF89842"}, "display_name": "Spacewalk", "keywords": ["alien", "shooter", "space", "pistol", "arcade"], "long_description": "The station has been overrun. You have two pistols, a safe room, and one shift to get the numbers up.\n\nHOW IT PLAYS\nChoose a 5, 10 or 15 minute shift and step out of the safe room. Aliens hunt you room to room through the station's corridors, hangars, reactor and decks. They scream when they spot you and you can hear their footsteps coming from behind. Every kill counts. When the clock hits zero your shift is scored: aliens killed, your best for that level and shift length, accuracy and headshots.\n\nDUAL-WIELD PISTOLS\nA pistol in each hand, each on its own trigger, with real recoil, muzzle flash and ejecting brass.\n\nSEVEN LEVELS\nStation, Red Alert, Nebula Deck, Neon Nights, Deep Ocean, Toxic Lab and Candy Station. Each changes the whole station's look and the view out of the safe room's window, from a molten planet to a synthwave sunset.\n\nTHE SAFE ROOM\nAliens cannot get in. Catch your breath, take in the view, change level or music, and head back out.\n\nMADE FOR COMFORT\nSmooth locomotion with a fast-walk button, snap turning, and a pause that freezes the world. Time and kills stay off your screen until you want them.\n\nFEATURES\n- Single player, fully offline\n- 5, 10 and 15 minute shifts with best scores for every level\n- 7 levels and 9 original music tracks\n- Dual-wield pistols\n- Aliens that hunt, flank and chase you through a 19-room station", "short_description": "Hold the station. Spacewalk is a dual-pistol VR shooter aboard a sprawling space station overrun by aliens. Pick a 5, 10 or 15 minute shift, hunt them through corridors, hangars and decks, and kill as many as you can before the clock runs out. Seven levels, from Red Alert to Neon Nights, a safe room with a view, and an original soundtrack."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-spacewalk.pages.dev/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-spacewalk.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_gra